  "specialRules": "Hate Dark Elves: All warriors in the warband, excluding Hired Swords, Hate Dark Elves. | Excellent Sight: Elves in the warband spot Hidden enemies from twice as far away as other warriors, at a distance in inches equal to twice their Initiative. | Unforgiving: In multiplayer games the warband may never ally with a chaotic warband such as Possessed, Skaven, Beastmen or Dark Elves. | Tolerant: The warband may hire any Hired Sword that is not of a Chaotic or evil bent, so no Skaven, Possessed, Beastmen, Dark Elves, Undead and so on. | Elven Wargear Prices: In the warband lists the Elf Bow costs 35 gc, the Elven Cloak 75 gc, Elven Wine 50 gc, Hunting Arrows 35 gc and Ithilmar armour 60 gc. An Ithilmar weapon costs twice the base weapon's price. | Ithilmar Availability: Ithilmar weapons and armour are for Heroes only. No roll is needed when founding the warband; afterwards they must be found with a rarity roll as normal (Wood Elves pay normal prices, not the Ulthuan price)."
